<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's IGCP to hold bond auctions Friday.</title>
<headline>Portugal's IGCP to hold bond auctions Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Institute for Public Credit Management said it would hold an extraordinary auction of 20 billion escudos of three-year fixed rate bonds, 20 billion escudos of five-year fixed rate bonds and 20 billion escudos of 10-year fixed rate bonds on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
